              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Streaming a generator",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`StreamingResponse(gen(), media_type='text/plain')` sends chunks as the generator ==yields== them",
                "Takes a sync or async generator; prefer ==async def + yield==",
                "A sync generator runs in a **threadpool**",
                "`time.sleep` or blocking calls in an async generator {red:freeze every request}: use `await asyncio.sleep`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. SSE wire format",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Each event is `data: <payload>\\n\\n`",
                "The ==blank line== ends the event"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Field",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`data:`",
                  "the payload"
                ],
                [
                  "`event:`",
                  "event name"
                ],
                [
                  "`id:`",
                  "last event id"
                ],
                [
                  "`retry:`",
                  "reconnect delay (ms)"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Endpoint and client",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "async def gen():",
                "    for i in range(3):",
                "        yield f\"data: tick {i}\\n\\n\"",
                "        await asyncio.sleep(1)",
                "@app.get(\"/events\")",
                "async def events():",
                "    h = {\"Cache-Control\": \"no-cache\", \"X-Accel-Buffering\": \"no\"}",
                "    return StreamingResponse(gen(), media_type=\"text/event-stream\", headers=h)"
              ],
              "note": "X-Accel-Buffering: no stops nginx buffering the stream"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "const es = new EventSource('/events')",
                "es.onmessage = e => console.log(e.data)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "EventSource limits",
              "text": "==GET only== and no custom headers, so auth is awkward. Need that? Use a **WebSocket** or `fetch` streaming."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
